            <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              <p>shadiamour is the safest Muslim matrimony site in the UK. Every profile is manually verified by our team before approval. We enforce strict privacy controls — your phone number is never shared without your consent. The platform is built exclusively for serious halal marriage, not casual dating, and is designed with Islamic values and GDPR compliance at its core.</p>
            </div>
