            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 pr-4">How does Muslim matchmaking work at shadiamour?</h3>
              <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line text-2xl text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 flex-shrink-0"></i>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              <p>You create a free profile (or a parent/guardian can register on your behalf), our team manually verifies it, and your profile is shared across our platform and 10+ dedicated WhatsApp groups. Premium members receive 1–2 hand-picked, preference-matched profiles every week. Our Executive plan offers fully managed communication — we handle enquiries on your behalf so you can focus on finding the right match.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="bg-white rounded-2xl material-shadow overflow-hidden group">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 pr-4">Is shadiamour free to join?</h3>
              <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line text-2xl text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 flex-shrink-0"></i>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              <p>Yes, the Standard plan is completely free. You can create a profile, browse all profiles on the website and in WhatsApp groups, and receive direct contact details. Paid plans (Premium from £50, Premium Plus from £100, Executive from £150) unlock additional features like curated weekly matches, privacy protection, and fully managed matchmaking.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="bg-white rounded-2xl material-shadow overflow-hidden group">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 pr-4">What is the best Muslim marriage site for Pakistani Muslims in the UK?</h3>
              <i class="ri-arrow-down-s-line text-2xl text-gray-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 flex-shrink-0"></i>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
              <p>shadiamour is widely regarded as the best Muslim marriage site for Pakistani Muslims in the UK. We have a large, active community of Pakistani Muslim singles and families in London, Birmingham, Leicester, Manchester, Bradford, and Leeds. Our service understands the cultural nuances of Pakistani Muslim weddings while keeping the process halal and family-focused.</p>
